  "question": {
    "text": "If <math><mi>M</mi></math> and <math><mi>m</mi></math> are the maximum and minimum values of <math><mfrac><mrow><mi>y</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfrac></math> for pair of real numbers&nbsp;<math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>,</mo><mi></mi><mi>y</mi></mrow></mfenced></math> which satisfy the equation <math><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>6</mn></math>, then the value of <math><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">M</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mi>m</mi></mrow></mfrac></math> is",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [],
  "correctValue": "6",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/nta_abhyas/jee_main/images/163277b4-0ab9-43d4-a8db-336e657e6007.png\" style=\"max-width:100%; object-fit:contain\" style=\"width:2.58681in;height:2.28681in\" /></p><p>Let <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mi>y</mi><mi>x</mi></mfrac><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>m</mi><mo>'</mo></msup></math>. So, on putting <math> <mrow> <mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><msup> <mi>m</mi> <mo>′</mo> </msup> <mi>x</mi></mrow> </math> in the given circle,<br />We get <math> <mrow> <msup> <mrow> <mfenced> <mrow> <mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow> </mfenced></mrow> <mn>2</mn> </msup> <mo>+</mo><msup> <mrow> <mfenced> <mrow> <msup> <mi>m</mi> <mo>′</mo> </msup> <mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow> </mfenced></mrow> <mn>2</mn> </msup> <mo>=</mo><mn>6</mn></mrow> </math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>m</mi><mrow><msup><mo>'</mo><mrow></mrow></msup><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mn>6</mn><mi>x</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>m</mi><mo>'</mo></msup></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mn>12</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math><br />Putting discriminant <math><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math>, we get,<br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>m</mi><mo>'</mo></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><munder><mo>+</mo><mo>_</mo></munder><mn>2</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></math><br />So, m = <math><mn>3</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn><mi></mi></msqrt></math> and <math><mi>M</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn><mi></mi></msqrt><mo>⇒</mo><mi>m</mi><mi>M</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math><br /><math><mo>⇒</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mi>M</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mi>m</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mi>m</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>M</mi></math><br /><math><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></math><br /><math><mo>=</mo><mn>6</mn></math></p>",
    "image": null
  },
